  "content": "{section: Intro}\n[Gadd9] [G9/F] (x4)\n\n{section: Verso 1}\n[Gadd9]Don't even think about reachin' me [G9/F] [Gadd9] [G9/F]\nI won't be home [Gadd9] [G9/F] [Gadd9] [G9/F]\n[Gadd9]Don't even think about stoppin' by [G9/F] [Gadd9] [G9/F]\nDon't think of me at all [Gadd9] [G9/F] [Gadd9] [G9/F]\n\n{section: Refrão}\n[C] [Cadd9] [Em7]I did a what I had to do [C]\nIf there was a reason, [Em7] [C]it was you\n\n{section: Interlúdio}\n[Gadd9] [G9/F] (x4)\n\n{section: Verso 2}\n[Gadd9]I don't even think about getting inside [G9/F] [Gadd9] [G9/F]\nVoices in my head, ooh voices\n\n{section: Refrão 2}\n[C] [Cadd9] [Em7]I got scratches all over my arms [C]\nOne for each day [Em7] [C]since I fell apart\n[C] [Cadd9] [Em7]I did a what I had to do [C]\nIf there was a reason, [Em7] [C]it was you\n\n{section: Pós-Refrão}\n[Em] [D/F#] [G]Footsteps in the hall [A] [Em] [D/F#]\nIt was you [G] [A] [Asus4] [A]\n[Em] [D/F#] [G]Pictures on my chest [A] [Em] [D/F#]\nIt was you [G] [A] [Asus4] [A]\n\n{section: Solo (harmonica)}\n[Gadd9] [G9/F] (x4)\n\n{section: Refrão 3}\n[C] [Cadd9] [Em7]I did a what I had to do [C]\nIf there a was a reason, [Em7] [C]it was you\n[C] [Cadd9] [Em7]If there's something you'd like to do [C]\nOh, just let me [Em7] [C]continue to blame you\n\n{section: Pós-Refrão}\n[Em] [D/F#] [G]Footsteps in the hall [A] [Em] [D/F#]\nIt was you [G] [A] [Asus4] [A]\n[Em] [D/F#] [G]Pictures on my chest [A] [Em] [D/F#]\nIt was you [G] [A] [Asus4] [A]\n\n{section: Outro}\n[Gadd9] [G9/F] (x4)"
